{
  "key": 18235,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "CelesticTown_Text_OddSpaceman",
      "en_US": [
        "There’s an odd spaceman\n",
        "in front of the ruins.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CelesticTown_Text_WillYouMessWithMe",
      "en_US": [
        "This town is insignificant!\n",
        "There’s nothing of value here.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CelesticTown_Text_YouDareOpposeUs",
      "en_US": [
        "You dare to oppose Team Galactic?\r",
        "That means you’re taking on the\n",
        "world... No, the universe, even!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CelesticTown_Text_VerySmart",
      "en_US": [
        "That’s right! Very smart!\n",
        "You know what’s good for you!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CelesticTown_Text_TooMuchToHandle",
      "en_US": [
        "Too much to handle...\n",
        "I can’t do anything here...\r",
        "This place is nothing!\n",
        "I’ll be happily rid of this place!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CelesticTown_Text_ThatOldCharm",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh, you were magnificent!\n",
        "Aren’t you quite the Trainer?\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CelesticTown_Text_PlayerHandedOverCharm",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} handed over\n",
        "the {STRVAR_1 8, 1, 0} to the elder."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CelesticTown_Text_LookAroundRuins",
      "en_US": [
        "This Old Charm is something made in\n",
        "Celestic Town long, long ago.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CelesticTown_Text_ExamineRuins",
      "en_US": [
        "You’ve gone to the trouble of visiting\n",
        "Celestic Town.\r",
        "Why not take a little more time to\n",
        "examine the ruins?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CelesticTown_Text_WasEverythingAllRight",
      "en_US": [
        "Cynthia: Was everything all right here?\r",
        "You saw those strange people with\n",
        "a Galactic Bomb, didn’t you?\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CelesticTown_Text_ThoughtGalacticWasHarmless",
      "en_US": [
        "But those Team Galactic people...!\n",
        "I thought they were harmless.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CelesticTown_Text_LibraryInCanalave",
      "en_US": [
        "By the way, were the ruins fun to\n",
        "explore?\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CelesticTown_Text_StudyingLocalHistory",
      "en_US": [
        "Howdy!\n",
        "Studying up on local history?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CelesticTown_Text_APokemonCreatedSinnoh",
      "en_US": [
        "Hey, do you know what they say?\r",
        "They say a Pokémon created the\n",
        "Sinnoh region."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CelesticTown_Text_NoPokemonMart",
      "en_US": [
        "There’s no Pokémon Mart in this\n",
        "town...\r",
        "Instead, you can buy and sell items\n",
        "in this house here."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CelesticTown_Text_MapSign",
      "en_US": [
        "Celestic Town\n",
        "The Past Lives"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CelesticTown_Text_EtchingDialga",
      "en_US": [
        "A giant etching of a Pokémon-like\n",
        "creature covers the wall...\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CelesticTown_Text_EtchingPalkia",
      "en_US": [
        "A giant etching of a Pokémon-like\n",
        "creature covers the wall...\r"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
